	And the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive" should have the contact role "Member"
	And the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive" should have the contact role "Optional Account Customer Role"
	And the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive" should have the contact role "Member"
	And the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive" should not have the contact role "Optional Account Customer Role"
	And the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive" should not have the contact role "Default Account Customer Role"
	And the account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" should be assigned the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" with the customer contact role "Default Account Customer Role"
